<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits set homes and shops ablaze and burned an entire village in Niger, killing three civilians, while an armed group killed 13 soldiers in southwestern Niger, an attack claimed by Islamic State. In a separate incident, militants killed at least 30 civilians in a reprisal attack in Niger State, Nigeria, and kidnapped a Saudi national. Insurgents are now employing off-the-shelf drones in their attacks. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNdlczOXd0YnNLNGduUU5mYWd2U0pXeGI5djRWaEwwVDdvWkV1Y29CX3ZqX002US1HbWVMWkltU2MyeXJtYlNvR3BPMGc2blRWMk42djE2bGxjcVkwU2Y2NXE1MzdJWWt1WGlTN2stOGlZTzZJOTlJTlVBOU1LRmpRUmU3cTI1WWRDX3FNMkJjWW95WDg3dU9CYg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQalRVSlU1YTNnemtNa3lxUXFWSzBvd1BwUFg2T2dVOXlPVWl6SU55bWpRQmJiUW0zajRveXhwS1ZWQXVWTFlWazdpVkMzRkRkV3p6bk1GVUNRbGJWaUpkZ0JjSFhhanVldmtRbkJfS3Bzb1g2WHlFZ0ItQ1AycEtrMTdQRDRkUjQ4X1g2QVltWDBRdi1oOWkzMkRtcDNxUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQOW02QkhOc0JaNlIwNC04WmtfQUU5RVFWdlNteDZnY3ctZzUzanM2VGNsT0taUTZ0RHNKbVdqcXBXeE9xSVBvSFBlSUFadEVrOWhyRXEzd2x0bTN0NVJkNnpNN3ljMVhjc2FLYzlyXzNGdDdkcExnV3JsMkU2WTdmZWEwaWNFdV93NTZQa1d0UDFad3ZteGkyT3MxcDNlNFpEUnFXZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tribune Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPYlMwWFZ1dXNJdXVWLV9Bd2ZVcUZwQ1AtTkJoRUZXVk1FcmJwX3VmR2UtcXQzV1lERDN0YWlwWndSQjFLRVNxQmpjNEVBN1F4ZVJRY0sxdXhrSlBBdFFjdHVVaTVPMVN0MEkwT09XZERqVDV4aHo4NDZNY1lSZ3B0M1VqVFdULWN0ZXBqa